      "english": "Buying Shoes"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "simplified": "丽丽和男朋友小何去逛街。",
      "traditional": "麗麗和男朋友小何去逛街。",
      "pinyin": "lì lì hé nán péng you xiǎo hé qù guàng jiē",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "simplified": "\n    ",
      "traditional": "\n    ",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Lili and her boyfriend Little He went window-shopping."
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "simplified": "丽丽看上了一双鞋，想让小何买给她。",
      "traditional": "麗麗看上了一雙鞋，想讓小何買給她。",
      "pinyin": "lì lì kàn shàng le yì shuāng xié xiǎng ràng xiǎo hé mǎi gěi tā",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "simplified": "于是，她指了指自己的鞋子，撒娇道：",
      "traditional": "於是，她指了指自己的鞋子，撒嬌道：",
      "pinyin": "yú shì tā zhǐ le zhǐ zì jǐ de xié zi sā jiāo dào",
      "english": "Lili saw a pair of shoes that she liked, and wanted Little He to buy them for her."
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "simplified": "“亲爱的，人家的鞋有点挤脚，磨得人家脚都疼了……”",
      "traditional": "“親愛的，人家的鞋有點擠腳，磨得人家腳都疼了……”",
      "pinyin": "qīn ài de rén jia de xié yǒu diǎn jǐ jiǎo mó de rén jia jiǎo dōu téng le",
      "english": "She then pointed at her own shoes, and childishly said:"
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "simplified": "\n    ",
      "traditional": "\n    ",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "“Darling, someone's shoes are a bit tight. They rub against the foot so it hurts…”"
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "simplified": "小何看着丽丽，笑着说：“行了，行了，我知道啦！”",
      "traditional": "小何看著麗麗，笑著說：“行了，行了，我知道啦！”",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo hé kàn zhe lì lì xiào zhe shuō xíng le xíng le wǒ zhī dào la",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "simplified": "\n    ",
      "traditional": "\n    ",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Little He looked at Lili, laughed and said: “Ok, ok, I get it!”"
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "simplified": "丽丽心想，这下买鞋子有戏了！",
      "traditional": "麗麗心想，這下買鞋子有戲了！",
      "pinyin": "lì lì xīn xiǎng zhè xià mǎi xié zi yǒu xì le",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "simplified": "\n    ",
      "traditional": "\n    ",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Lili thought to herself: It looks like I can get new shoes!"
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "simplified": "但只见小何背起丽丽，一路走回了家……",
      "traditional": "但只見小何背起麗麗，一路走回了家……",
