    "sentence_translations": [
      "Buying Shoes",
      "",
      "Lili and her boyfriend Little He went window-shopping.",
      "",
      "Lili saw a pair of shoes that she liked, and wanted Little He to buy them for her.",
      "She then pointed at her own shoes, and childishly said:",
      "“Darling, someone's shoes are a bit tight. They rub against the foot so it hurts…”",
      "",
      "Little He looked at Lili, laughed and said: “Ok, ok, I get it!”",
      "",
      "Lili thought to herself: It looks like I can get new shoes!",
      "",
      "But instead Little He picked up Lili, and carried her all the way home…"
